# Candidate Sidebar Menu

When working on the candidate layout/sidebar, preserve the current sidebar menu structure and visual presentation unless the user explicitly asks to change it.

- Keep the candidate identity block at the top with avatar, "Espace candidat", candidate name, and profile completion.
- Keep the main menu order: Suivi, Offres, Enregistrées, Profil, Paramètres.
- Keep the Annuaire section title and order: Annuaire sociétés, Annuaire formations, Annuaire établissements.
- Keep the bottom links: Accueil, Déconnexion.
- Do not rename labels, reorder groups, move directory links elsewhere, or restyle the sidebar menu unless the user specifically requests that sidebar change.
